      "blocks": {
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Monthlies?",
            "row_content": "<p>We're a group of women dedicated to the idea that you deserve more than just painkillers to relieve menstrual discomfort. </p><p>Drawing from extensive research and expertise, we've developed the Monthlies box – a personalised set of products designed to support you through every phase of your cycle. </p><p>Our offerings go beyond carefully curated products; we provide insightful guidance on incorporating them into your daily routine, along with daily nutrition and exercise tips.</p><p> We also offer optional consultations with one of our experts to make your next Monthlies box even better.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can you help me find the products and expert advice that works best for me?",
            "row_content": "<p>Sure thing!</p><p>That's why we've created the cycle Quiz. Based on your answers, we’ll provide expert guidance tailored to your needs, and a set of handy tips and tricks to improve your daily habits. Your box will also contain a set of hand-picked products to address your specific symptoms, and the chance to consult with one of our experts.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are the recommendations free of charge?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! You get your recommendations absolutely for free after you take your cycle quiz.</p><p>We’ll also email them for easy access.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the data driven recommendation system work?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our cycle Quiz is a product of years of research, valuable feedback from real women, and the combined knowledge of our team and industry experts.</p><p>Based on your responses, our data-driven algorithm meticulously selects the products that cater to your unique needs.</p><p>Following this, our specialists will craft your personalised cycle guide, complete with tailored nutrition and exercise recommendations.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "9d60fd2b-0408-4be6-8837-23a723f9e07d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I buy the recommended products directly?",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely! </p><p>To start, we suggest a range of personally curated products based on your quiz results. You'll find them on the results page, and they will be automatically added to your cart.</p><p>From there, you can customise to your liking, adding or removing products according to your preferences.</p><p>Your personalised cycle guide, as well as your nutrition and exercise advice will be emailed to you and added to your Monthlies box once you have completed the purchase*.</p><p>After one month, you'll receive a link to schedule a call with one of our experts, ensuring you have the support you need on your journey towards better menstrual health*.  </p><p><em>*only for purchases over 40€</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "d6395c54-3255-4e41-b45a-29f75568265e": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I buy products individually from the shop?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, you can purchase products individually from our shop.  </p><p>While we offer a personalization service through our quiz, we also provide the option for customers to freely explore and purchase from our shop. </p><p>In the shop, you'll find various supplements, teas, accessories, and sets categorized based on symptoms.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "bf845a6b-ed70-4981-b487-257c64793082": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much does Monthlies box cost?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our recommendations are free. </p><p>Your personalised Monthlies box contains a set of 2 to 8 tailored products, including supplements, teas, and the latest innovations in cycle care.</p><p>On top of that, you can schedule a consultation with one of our experts after your first month. </p><p>The price depends on how many products you choose to try, starting at 39.90€.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2c361192-22dd-47ad-a812-62a01548ce09": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Monthlies a subscription?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, Monthlies offers both subscription and one-time purchase options.   </p><p>By subscribing, you can enjoy a price reduction, while the one-time purchase allows you to buy without committing to a recurring subscription.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "208c5a73-ee97-4d80-9369-a861c1222982": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take to receive my order?",
            "row_content": "<p>Shipping can take up to 10 days.</p><p>If you have any questions, please let us know at info@withmonthlies.com.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
